  "intro": "Supreme Commander is a weekly event that runs for 6 days. On Days 1–5 you earn event points by spending resources — the more valuable the resource, the more points it awards. The 6th day is Metropolis Maneuvers, a no-resource game mode where you attack other players' strategic strongholds on the map. This guide focuses on the most efficient path for an individual player to maximize points and rewards each day.",
