      "tips": [
        "One \"intel point reload\" is 120 intel. Bank all reloads from free side of monitor's legacy, plus any earned from darkest timeline.",
        "Do not buy intel from league store.",
        "Use 240 intel from points accumulated during the day.",
        "F2P - Use 4 reloads per supreme commander",
        "Lite Spend – buy monitor's legacy pass and you can use 15 reloads per supreme commander.",
        "Use the rest of your 40 Interstellar Visitor anvils here.",
        "Use approximately 1,100 drones to finish."
